  unitName: Thief God Zelnite
  unitId: 30445
  unitNumber: 618
  description: After amazingly revealing the secret of the Bariura Empire, the thief
    Zelnite, who rescued the people, delved into the night with his mantle aflutter
    once again today. And thus, that is how the Chivalrous Thief Zelnite earned his
    status and his name. Well then, let's meet again soon in "The Adventures of the
    Chivalrous Thief Zelnite and the Princess of the Wind!"(An excerpt from Chapter
    3 of "The Adventures of the Chivalrous Thief Zelnite!")
  summonDesc: Seeking refuge in the darkness.<br>Burdened with moral obligation.<br>I'm
    the dazzling Thief Zelnite!
  fusionDesc: The identity of the thief Zelnite<br>is top secret in this world.<br>Got
    it?<br>It's our little secret.
  evoDesc: All right!<br>I'll show you who the true Thief Zelnite is!
